<p>Using the midpoint<br>
We decide whether to move the left or right pointer based on the value in t=
he middle of the search space, indicated by the midpoint variable (<code>mi=
d</code>).</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a visual depiction of a data structure, lik=
